guide.kg.body.guide_seasoning_base.1=The three base ingredients are Green Chili Powder, Sichuan Pepper, and Onion Powder. All three are required before shaking the seasoning complete.
guide.kg.body.guide_seasoning_base.2=A seasoning bottle stores up to 8 ingredients and has 16 uses when finished.
guide.kg.body.guide_seasoning_redstone.1=Redstone grants Speed; using more of the same ingredient increases the effect strength.
guide.kg.body.guide_seasoning_gunpowder.1=Gunpowder grants Strength; using more of the same ingredient increases the effect strength.
guide.kg.body.guide_seasoning_houttuynia.1=Houttuynia Powder extends seasoning-effect duration; 4 or more gives the stronger duration extension.
guide.kg.body.guide_seasoning_totem.1=Totem Powder provides a heavy-metal survival effect that can prevent one lethal hit, followed by heavy-metal poisoning.
guide.kg.body.guide_seasoning_dragon.1=Dragon Egg Powder grants Dragon Blood, increasing maximum health and providing extra damage absorption.
guide.kg.body.guide_seasoning_pepper.1=Sichuan Pepper is also one of the three base ingredients; 4 or more triggers Numbness when the seasoned skewer is eaten hot.
